WEBVTT

02:23.650 --> 02:25.680
<b>The undead can get into the Kun well now!</b>

02:25.680 --> 02:27.430
<b>Where did we go wrong?</b>

02:27.430 --> 02:30.770
<b>A curse! It's a curse!</b>

02:30.770 --> 02:34.370
<b>The well god has abandoned us!</b>

02:44.630 --> 02:46.740
<b>Xiaohou! Xiaohou!</b>

02:46.740 --> 02:47.870
<b>Have you found him?</b>

02:51.890 --> 02:53.100
<b>I don't know you.</b>

02:54.450 --> 02:55.640
<b>You know Fu Da?</b>

02:56.270 --> 02:57.310
<b>Fu Da?</b>

02:57.310 --> 03:00.770
<b>That's the name I gave him, because...</b>

03:05.140 --> 03:08.460
<b>He seems to have lost his memories...</b>

03:09.990 --> 03:11.060
<b>You're hurting me!</b>

03:11.560 --> 03:13.320
<b>Don't be afraid. They're all good people.</b>

03:13.320 --> 03:14.430
<b>They're here to help us.</b>

03:15.430 --> 03:16.400
<b>What's the matter?</b>

03:18.260 --> 03:20.780
<b>Nothing... I'm glad you're alive.</b>

03:20.780 --> 03:22.100
<b>I'm glad you're alive!</b>

03:22.800 --> 03:26.140
<b>Chief Xie, do you know where my 
folks from Yangyang Village went?</b>

03:26.140 --> 03:28.430
<b>What happened to them?</b>

03:29.530 --> 03:32.870
<b>I don't know. The undead 
have been running rampant.</b>

03:32.870 --> 03:35.270
<b>We can barely take care of
 ourselves, let alone others...</b>

03:35.820 --> 03:38.790
<b>I said at the start that we 
shouldn't do things like that!</b>

03:38.790 --> 03:41.600
<b>Now we've all been cursed!</b>

03:41.600 --> 03:43.640
<b>Stop your nonsense! Go away!</b>

03:51.230 --> 03:54.050
<b>Fu Da, there's finally 
someone here for you.</b>

03:54.050 --> 03:57.310
<b>I was worried you'd have to stay 
here for the rest of your life.</b>

03:58.320 --> 03:59.240
<b>I'm not leaving.</b>

04:00.400 --> 04:01.640
<b><i>You idiot...</i></b>

04:03.040 --> 04:04.450
<b>Hoes before bros, I see...</b>

04:05.780 --> 04:08.350
<b>I never asked what 
you guys were doing here.</b>

04:08.790 --> 04:11.100
<b>A disagreeable colleague
 of mine came here.</b>

04:11.100 --> 04:12.470
<b>I'm here to have a chat with him.</b>

04:14.030 --> 04:15.560
<b>Which organization are you from?</b>

04:16.000 --> 04:17.350
<b>Temple of Glory.</b>

04:18.270 --> 04:19.600
<b>I think I've heard of that.</b>

04:19.930 --> 04:21.520
<b>Yes, we're quite well-known.</b>

04:23.290 --> 04:26.360
<b>You're not some sort of saint or 
princess or anything, are you?</b>

04:26.360 --> 04:28.470
<b>Covering your face to go undercover?</b>

04:30.050 --> 04:31.830
<b>I'm not that pure.</b>

04:31.830 --> 04:33.700
<b>The veil is just a personal choice.</b>

04:33.700 --> 04:34.810
<b>I think it's beautiful.</b>

04:37.310 --> 04:38.500
<b>The sun should be up.</b>

04:38.500 --> 04:40.180
<b>Let's check the situation outside.</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:49.500
<b>Why is the water level 
suddenly lowering?</b>

04:50.240 --> 04:52.320
<b>It looks like we'll have to 
leave from another exit.</b>

05:02.220 --> 05:04.520
<b>The well water... Why's it all gone?</b>

05:05.420 --> 05:06.900
<b>The water is gone!</b>

05:06.900 --> 05:07.560
<b>Go, go!</b>

05:09.060 --> 05:10.250
<b>Go quickly! Go look!</b>

05:11.840 --> 05:13.290
<b>It's really gone!</b>

05:14.250 --> 05:15.470
<b>Oh, heavens!</b>

05:15.470 --> 05:18.710
<b>You really are trying to take the 
lives of everyone in this village!</b>

05:18.710 --> 05:20.590
<b>If I've done wrong, then just punish me!</b>

05:20.590 --> 05:23.350
<b>Forgive these innocent villagers!</b>

05:23.820 --> 05:25.590
<b>Dad, you did it for everyone.</b>

05:25.590 --> 05:26.720
<b>You didn't do anything wrong.</b>

05:26.720 --> 05:27.810
<b>Isn't that right, everybody?</b>

05:28.490 --> 05:31.300
<b>The village is ruined.
The well is ruined...</b>

05:31.300 --> 05:33.430
<b>What are we going to do now?</b>

05:33.940 --> 05:35.860
<b>Why don't we all move to Tin City?</b>

05:35.860 --> 05:36.970
<b>I have friends there.</b>

05:36.970 --> 05:39.020
<b>They can help settle all of our villagers.</b>

05:39.020 --> 05:40.660
<b>Tin City is protected by the wall.</b>

05:40.660 --> 05:42.640
<b>It'll be better than cowering here.</b>

05:43.560 --> 05:45.680
<b>I think that's a great idea!</b>

05:45.680 --> 05:49.440
<b>Su Xiaoluo, Fu Da seems to 
know those powerful mages.</b>

05:49.440 --> 05:51.720
<b>Should we ask them to escort us?</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:55.840
<b>Fu Da, are you going to 
leave with your friends,</b>

05:55.840 --> 05:57.390
<b>or are you staying with us?</b>

05:57.850 --> 05:59.810
<b>I... I'll go where you go.</b>

06:01.000 --> 06:02.640
<b>I'm going with everyone.</b>

06:02.640 --> 06:03.720
<b>Then I'll go with everyone.</b>

06:05.220 --> 06:06.950
<b>Where he is is where I'll be.</b>

06:06.950 --> 06:09.310
<b>His business is my business.</b>

06:09.780 --> 06:11.250
<b>That's wonderful.</b>

06:11.250 --> 06:13.900
<b>With mages alongside us, 
we'll have protection.</b>

06:13.900 --> 06:15.880
<b>Everyone, pack up quickly!</b>

06:15.880 --> 06:17.470
<b>Remember to bring ashen garlic!</b>

06:21.120 --> 06:22.340
<b>We have to go back anyway.</b>

06:22.340 --> 06:27.060
<b>With more people, we have a 
lower chance of being attacked.</b>

06:28.390 --> 06:30.280
<b>Let's help however we can.</b>

06:30.850 --> 06:33.950
<b>Mo Fan, we still have 
business to attend to.</b>

06:33.950 --> 06:35.270
<b>Let's say our farewells here.</b>

06:35.870 --> 06:36.630
<b>Right.</b>

06:37.570 --> 06:39.640
<b>May we meet again, Ye Cuihua.</b>

06:50.400 --> 06:51.920
<b>Which route are we taking on the way back?</b>

06:51.920 --> 06:53.240
<b>The one through Yangyang Village.</b>

06:53.240 --> 06:55.140
<b>That's the one route back to Tin City.</b>

06:58.390 --> 07:02.050
<b>By the way, the villagers at Hua Village</b>

07:02.050 --> 07:04.800
<b>really didn't attract undead with
all that Kun well water they drink.</b>

07:04.800 --> 07:06.860
<b>As long as we don't run
 into those mutated undead,</b>

07:06.860 --> 07:08.850
<b>we should get back to 
Tin City no problem.</b>

07:09.340 --> 07:10.560
<b>That's true.</b>

07:10.560 --> 07:13.930
<b>Not only that, but being protected
 by these undead insulators</b>

07:13.930 --> 07:15.280
<b>means we won't have to fight as hard,</b>

07:15.280 --> 07:16.620
<b>and we'll also travel faster.</b>

07:20.490 --> 07:23.100
<b>Liu Ru, watch the kids.</b>

07:41.430 --> 07:42.930
<b>We're at Yangyang Village!</b>

07:45.680 --> 07:46.830
<b>Let's keep going.</b>

07:46.830 --> 07:48.720
<b>As soon as we get to Tin City,
you'll all be safe.</b>

07:49.150 --> 07:51.350
<b>I know, I know...</b>

07:52.250 --> 07:56.470
<b>Fellow villagers, we'll be at Tin City
soon after we get through this village!</b>

07:57.820 --> 07:58.470
<b>Let's go!</b>

08:05.890 --> 08:06.970
<b>Auntie Liu!</b>

08:09.250 --> 08:11.380
<b>Second Uncle! Little Sis! Little Bro!</b>

08:11.380 --> 08:12.610
<b>You're all here!</b>

08:12.610 --> 08:13.930
<b>I was so scared!</b>

08:15.510 --> 08:17.830
<b>Impossible... That's impossible...</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:20.470
<b>How can they still be... alive?!</b>

08:21.590 --> 08:22.350
<b>What do you mean?</b>

08:22.790 --> 08:26.310
<b>Not long ago, the chief of 
Yangyang Village, Fang Gu, came to us</b>

08:26.310 --> 08:28.910
<b>in the middle of the night to 
beg us for Kun well water.</b>

08:28.910 --> 08:31.440
<b>We rejected them saying that 
we didn't have enough.</b>

08:31.440 --> 08:35.090
<b>Then we heard that their 
entire village perished.</b>

08:36.390 --> 08:37.430
<b>Then they're...</b>

08:40.710 --> 08:42.550
<b>Something's wrong! They're not alive!</b>

08:42.550 --> 08:43.720
<b>Big Guy, don't go!</b>

08:49.020 --> 08:50.370
<b>Big Guy!</b>

08:53.500 --> 08:55.390
<b>Don't run off!</b>

09:03.970 --> 09:05.600
<b>Undead! There are undead here, too!</b>

09:05.600 --> 09:07.110
<b>They're all from Yangyang Village!</b>

09:07.110 --> 09:08.310
<b>They're here for our lives!</b>

09:09.910 --> 09:11.790
<b>Undead are appearing 
during the day again!</b>

09:11.790 --> 09:13.610
<b>What else are you hiding from us?!</b>

09:13.610 --> 09:16.630
<b>If you don't tell us now, I'll feed
you to the undead myself!</b>

09:16.630 --> 09:20.350
<b>Fang Gu... Yangyang's chief...</b>

09:20.350 --> 09:22.770
<b>Let me tell you.</b>

09:23.370 --> 09:24.770
<b>It's Fang Gu!</b>

09:27.390 --> 09:32.580
<b>That night, I begged Hua Village 
for a bit of Kun well water</b>

09:32.580 --> 09:35.680
<b>to help my village survive.</b>

09:36.080 --> 09:37.260
<b>But you...</b>

09:38.010 --> 09:40.690
<b>You left us to die!</b>

09:41.600 --> 09:46.790
<b>I couldn't bear to see
my villagers devoured...</b>

09:46.790 --> 09:51.500
<b>So I had to kill them myself, one by one.</b>

09:54.760 --> 09:57.210
<b>Do you understand how that feels?</b>

09:57.210 --> 09:59.690
<b>Do you know what I did that for?!</b>

10:00.570 --> 10:03.500
<b>Yes. I hate you all.</b>

10:03.500 --> 10:06.220
<b>Everyone in Hua Village deserves to die!</b>

10:07.360 --> 10:10.270
<b>I know why these undead are 
appearing in the day now!</b>

10:10.270 --> 10:12.020
<b>Fang Gu is a necromancer!</b>

10:12.020 --> 10:15.970
<b>He turned all of his villagers 
into undead under his control!</b>

10:25.580 --> 10:29.160
<b>Welcome back, Big Guy.</b>

10:29.160 --> 10:31.060
<b>Join me and take revenge!</b>

10:32.340 --> 10:34.060
<b>You sick bastard!</b>

10:54.480 --> 10:57.020
<b>Mommy! Mommy!</b>

10:59.680 --> 11:00.270
<b>Wind...</b>

11:01.070 --> 11:01.680
<b>Wind...</b>

11:05.520 --> 11:06.610
<b>Wind Coil!</b>

11:12.260 --> 11:12.930
<b>Heaven's Net!</b>

11:17.340 --> 11:18.310
<b>Fu Da...</b>

11:18.880 --> 11:22.130
<b><i>Good for you! Thank goodness you 
haven't forgotten your magic!</i></b>

11:22.130 --> 11:23.430
<b>Xiaohou, use Rock Barrier!</b>

11:23.720 --> 11:24.600
<b>Rock Barrier!</b>

11:28.220 --> 11:29.470
<b>Come hide in here! Quickly!</b>

11:34.160 --> 11:36.930
<b>Liu Ru, bring everyone in who's 
scattered around the outside!</b>

11:54.400 --> 11:56.260
<b>Help... Help me!</b>

12:09.560 --> 12:11.090
<b>Is he one of yours?</b>

12:11.090 --> 12:13.680
<b>Yes, yes! That's Nine from our village!</b>

12:23.690 --> 12:25.640
<b>Who let you stick your
 nose in our business?!</b>

12:25.640 --> 12:27.220
<b>Die now!</b>

12:31.070 --> 12:32.810
<b>Why... Why?!</b>

12:33.300 --> 12:35.630
<b>I sympathize with what
 you've gone through.</b>

12:35.630 --> 12:37.430
<b>But what you've done is too evil!</b>

12:39.200 --> 12:41.470
<b>H-How is this possible?!</b>

12:42.470 --> 12:44.210
<b>I'm sending you to the next life.</b>

12:44.210 --> 12:45.470
<b>You'll do no further harm!</b>

12:53.470 --> 12:55.440
<b>I've severed the carotid artery in his neck.</b>

12:55.440 --> 12:57.700
<b>Even a necromancer
 can't survive that.</b>

12:58.240 --> 13:00.600
<b>Let's get everyone out of here first!</b>

13:12.570 --> 13:14.680
<b>Those undead aren't coming after us.</b>

13:15.440 --> 13:17.970
<b>I killed that necromancer.</b>

13:19.650 --> 13:20.930
<b>Damn, Sis! Good for you!</b>

13:21.920 --> 13:22.890
<b>How are your injuries?</b>

13:22.890 --> 13:24.510
<b>They're not a problem.</b>

13:24.510 --> 13:27.140
<b>I'll just have you take
 care of me tonight.</b>

13:40.640 --> 13:43.200
<b>The Weiju villages near Xianchi
have been hit with disasters</b>

13:43.200 --> 13:44.680
<b>with very few survivors.</b>

13:44.680 --> 13:46.870
<b>Hua Village managed to
keep most people alive...</b>

13:46.870 --> 13:48.380
<b>That's a miracle...</b>

13:51.920 --> 13:53.060
<b>I'll be going now.</b>

13:54.250 --> 13:56.480
<b>You lost a friend because of us.</b>

13:56.480 --> 13:57.430
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

13:58.710 --> 14:01.500
<b>We hunters risk our lives
every day. It's part of the job.</b>

14:01.500 --> 14:02.680
<b>It's farewell here.</b>

14:04.020 --> 14:05.890
<b>All right. See you.</b>

14:07.450 --> 14:08.350
<b>Come here.</b>

14:08.350 --> 14:10.580
<b>Thank you. Without you guys,</b>

14:10.580 --> 14:12.850
<b>we would've ended up 
like the other Weiju villages.</b>

14:13.470 --> 14:14.310
<b>We did what we had to.</b>

14:14.310 --> 14:15.680
<b>You guys saved Xiaohou,</b>

14:15.680 --> 14:18.600
<b>so I'm just returning the favor.</b>

14:21.840 --> 14:25.020
<b>I heard from the villagers that your 
companion seems a bit strange.</b>

14:25.020 --> 14:29.640
<b>They're a bit afraid, so 
we'll say our goodbyes here.</b>

14:31.360 --> 14:33.270
<b>A bunch of ungrateful wretches!</b>

14:34.320 --> 14:35.680
<b>As long as you're all set.</b>

14:36.060 --> 14:38.020
<b>Fu Da, then you...</b>

14:41.020 --> 14:43.200
<b>He seems to have gone through a big shock.</b>

14:43.200 --> 14:44.470
<b>He only feels safe around you.</b>

14:45.890 --> 14:48.110
<b>I tried to convince him already,</b>

14:48.110 --> 14:50.860
<b>but this idiot keeps refusing 
to go anywhere else.</b>

14:50.860 --> 14:54.020
<b>He... He insists on coming with me...</b>

14:56.560 --> 14:59.730
<b>Then I'll have to ask you to 
hold onto him for now.</b>

14:59.730 --> 15:01.180
<b>Maybe he'll get better with time.</b>

15:01.180 --> 15:03.260
<b>Let's go, Xiaoluo!</b>

15:03.260 --> 15:04.540
<b>Coming!</b>

15:04.540 --> 15:06.400
<b>I'll send you our address 
once we're settled.</b>

15:06.400 --> 15:08.340
<b>Come see Fu Da whenever
 you have the chance.</b>

15:08.340 --> 15:10.270
<b>I hope he recovers soon, too.</b>

15:10.270 --> 15:11.350
<b>All right.</b>

15:13.850 --> 15:16.090
<b>Why are you bringing this 
stupid kid with you?</b>

15:16.090 --> 15:18.020
<b>He saved our lives!</b>

15:18.020 --> 15:19.300
<b>He's one of us!</b>

15:22.980 --> 15:25.680
<b>You think there are undead within them?</b>

15:26.230 --> 15:29.520
<b>Yes. They won't show 
themselves with us here.</b>

15:29.970 --> 15:32.350
<b>You keep an eye on them just in case.</b>

15:32.850 --> 15:35.100
<b>What is it? Is there something else?</b>

15:36.110 --> 15:36.720
<b>Not really.</b>

15:37.450 --> 15:41.870
<b>I just remembered that a lot of us 
from Bo City ended up in Tin City.</b>

15:41.870 --> 15:43.560
<b>I'm going to find them.</b>

15:43.560 --> 15:45.490
<b>If Xiaohou's really lost his memories,</b>

15:45.490 --> 15:47.510
<b>maybe bringing him near familiar people</b>

15:47.510 --> 15:49.470
<b>would help him remember something.</b>

15:50.130 --> 15:51.440
<b>Go ahead, then.</b>

15:51.440 --> 15:53.480
<b>Don't worry. Leave Hua Village to me.</b>

15:55.280 --> 15:56.620
<b>Cheers!</b>

15:57.850 --> 16:00.880
<b>I miss those times we used to have.</b>

16:00.880 --> 16:02.600
<b>If only they were still alive...</b>

16:05.540 --> 16:07.830
<b>The Black Church really went too far!</b>

16:07.830 --> 16:10.720
<b>Didn't you have a shift tonight, Zhou Min?</b>

16:10.720 --> 16:14.250
<b>You should let us come with you to vent 
our frustrations on some undead!</b>

16:14.250 --> 16:15.470
<b>That's right!</b>

16:15.470 --> 16:18.040
<b>What's so fun about eating 
dinner and singing karaoke?</b>

16:18.040 --> 16:20.470
<b>We should be farming levels 
by killing monsters!</b>

16:23.560 --> 16:25.330
<b>I actually just got back from outside.</b>

16:25.330 --> 16:26.880
<b>I'm exhausted...</b>

16:26.880 --> 16:29.520
<b>Oh, come on, let's go!</b>

16:37.150 --> 16:38.180
<b>Let's take a look!</b>

17:01.720 --> 17:04.720
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:04.720 --> 17:07.720
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:07.720 --> 17:10.720
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:10.720 --> 17:13.720
<b>Timer and Final Quality Control:
Henry Lin</b>

18:30.020 --> 19:01.770
<b>PREVIEW</b>

18:30.220 --> 18:33.220
<b>Attention! General-rank 
undead appearing northeast!</b>

18:33.220 --> 18:34.960
<b>Go annihilate immediately!</b>

18:34.960 --> 18:37.680
<b>The body of the Fierce Bone General 
is frozen and strong as steel.</b>

18:37.680 --> 18:42.270
<b>It’s far more difficult to deal with 
than other undead of the same rank.</b>

18:43.080 --> 18:44.680
<b>We'll just have to fight it head-on.</b>

18:46.000 --> 18:47.350
<b>That's the alarm.</b>

18:47.350 --> 18:49.020
<b>Another big one is coming.</b>

18:49.020 --> 18:52.160
<b>Damn this place! How can people 
live here where it's so crowded?!</b>

18:52.160 --> 18:54.890
<b>It's not like you guys will be living 
here for much longer anyway.</b>

18:54.890 --> 18:58.140
<b>Encountering you means something 
bad's gonna happen.</b>

18:58.460 --> 18:59.750
<b>You're already here.</b>

18:59.750 --> 19:01.770
<b>Help me think of a strategy.</b>
